WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:17.450
Diana Spencer, Princess of Wales died on the
31st August 1997, aged just 36.

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:22.930
What saddened people more than anything was
the suspicious circumstances around her death

00:00:22.930 --> 00:00:25.760
and rumours of murder and betrayal.

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:31.960
This caused mass hysteria, but to this day
we still don't fully understand what happened

00:00:31.960 --> 00:00:35.670
that night, on, and off, the streets of Paris.

00:00:35.670 --> 00:00:41.050
There have been many theories as to the reason
for her death, many suggest corruption inside

00:00:41.050 --> 00:00:46.260
the royal family and MI5, but what actually
happened on that night?

00:00:46.260 --> 00:00:52.680
Well here's some of the weirdest facts and
hidden evidence surrounding Diana's death:

00:00:52.680 --> 00:01:00.260
The car Diana was in at the time of the crash,
a black Mercedes S280, was the only available

00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:01.840
car that night.

00:01:01.840 --> 00:01:08.190
But the car had previously been stolen and
only recently found by the rental company

00:01:08.190 --> 00:01:09.460
who owned the car.

00:01:09.460 --> 00:01:15.790
When it was recovered the only thing missing
from the car was an onboard computer chip.

00:01:15.790 --> 00:01:21.660
This chip controlled the car's navigation,
acceleration, steering and braking.

00:01:21.660 --> 00:01:27.150
Some believe the original computer chip was
replaced with a doctored one that allowed

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:32.840
remote control of the vehicle, which would
easily allow for a staged crash.

00:01:32.840 --> 00:01:40.670
Depending on which report you read, the ambulance
took between 1 hour and 15 minutes and 1 hour

00:01:40.670 --> 00:01:45.759
and 40 minutes to get to the hospital, in
the middle of the night.

00:01:45.759 --> 00:01:50.200
However the journey should only take 11 minutes,
in rush hour.

00:01:50.200 --> 00:01:56.159
Mercedes point blankly refused to inspect
the wreckage, many believe because an experienced

00:01:56.159 --> 00:02:02.020
Mercedes engineer would immediately be able
to detect that the car had been tampered with.

00:02:02.020 --> 00:02:07.610
Journalists were told outright not to interview
anyone who mentioned "murder".

00:02:07.610 --> 00:02:13.760
Although the general consensus amongst the
public eluded to murder, the media never mentioned

00:02:13.760 --> 00:02:14.760
it.

00:02:14.760 --> 00:02:20.780
Just a few months before her death, Diana
criticised the Royal Family on the BBC's Panorama

00:02:20.780 --> 00:02:21.810
programme.

00:02:21.810 --> 00:02:28.190
Diana predicted her own death; she had given
her butler and lawyer hand-written notes for

00:02:28.190 --> 00:02:29.410
safe keeping.

00:02:29.410 --> 00:02:34.600
The note explained that Prince Charles was
planning a car accident to kill her.

00:02:34.600 --> 00:02:35.750
The letter reads:

00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:41.780
"I am sitting at my desk today longing for
someone to hug me and encourage me to keep

00:02:41.780 --> 00:02:44.000
strong and hold my head high.

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:47.060
This particular phase in my life is the most
dangerous.

00:02:47.060 --> 00:02:53.090
My husband is planning an accident in my car,
brake failure or some serious head injury

00:02:53.090 --> 00:02:56.610
in order to make the path clear for him to
marry Tiggy.

00:02:56.610 --> 00:03:02.240
Camilla is nothing more than a decoy so we
are being used by the man in every sense of

00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:03.300
the word."

00:03:03.300 --> 00:03:10.670
The ambulance driver was ordered by the onboard
doctor to stop and park outside Paris' Natural

00:03:10.670 --> 00:03:13.970
History Museum, because Diana was in a critical
condition.

00:03:13.970 --> 00:03:15.310
The ambulance driver parked for there for
more than 10 minutes.

00:03:15.310 --> 00:03:20.970
However, the hospital entrance was in plain
view of the parked ambulance, but no one rushed

00:03:20.970 --> 00:03:21.970
over to help.

00:03:21.970 --> 00:03:27.970
It would of only taken the ambulance another
30 seconds to drive to the hospital.

00:03:27.970 --> 00:03:33.739
Some believe it was in this ambulance journey
that her injuries were purposely made worse

00:03:33.739 --> 00:03:35.220
to ensure her death.

00:03:35.220 --> 00:03:41.579
Against all French laws, immediately a team
of embalmers illegally embalmed Diana's body,

00:03:41.579 --> 00:03:43.650
whilst it was still warm.

00:03:43.650 --> 00:03:48.720
This made any post-mortem examination extremely
difficult to perform.

00:03:48.720 --> 00:03:54.049
Therefore doctors were unable to find out
if there had been any tampering with her body

00:03:54.049 --> 00:03:55.580
during the ambulance journey.

00:03:55.580 --> 00:04:01.930
At the same time of the embalming, the tunnel
was washed down and opened for public use

00:04:01.930 --> 00:04:04.139
in just a couple of hours.

00:04:04.139 --> 00:04:11.350
The driver, Henri Paul, who died in the crash
was accused of consuming "grossly excessive

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:17.190
quantities of alcohol" and that his reckless
driving whilst under the influence of alcohol

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:18.489
caused the crash.

00:04:18.489 --> 00:04:23.699
Although almost every person who talked to
Henri Paul that night has said that he did

00:04:23.699 --> 00:04:27.400
not appear intoxicated before the crash.

00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:33.370
Blood samples apparently taken from Henri
Paul after the crash, showed that he was hopelessly

00:04:33.370 --> 00:04:34.370
drunk.

00:04:34.370 --> 00:04:37.080
But was it really his blood?

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:43.410
Interestingly, the blood contained a medicine
called Albendazole which Henri's doctor said

00:04:43.410 --> 00:04:44.970
he was never prescribed.

00:04:44.970 --> 00:04:52.169
But even more bizarrely, the same batch of
blood samples contained no trace of another

00:04:52.169 --> 00:04:58.360
medicine named Acamprostate which Henri Paul
had been prescribed.

00:04:58.360 --> 00:05:03.210
The intention of this video is not to point
fingers, I'm only presenting the evidence

00:05:03.210 --> 00:05:40.569
as it has been reported, I leave it to you
to form your own opinion.

